      "serialized_row_index": 7,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "僕はアルギュロさんに呼ばれ、\n彼女が住む山岳地帯の洞窟へとやってきていた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "c671990f3b911708f406a108bc73b6223267f4c5f83d6642ec068ad1f8ba2b32",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "いらっしゃい、ご主人さま。\nこんな山奥まで来てくれて、ありがとうございます。\nうぇへへへ……嬉しいなぁ、へへへ……。",
      "jp_sha256": "2d831b6fef6abb50833177fc86e61d107e20f6d10e940c196b721837f436f91c",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "어서 오세요, 주인님.\n이렇게 깊은 산속까지 와 주셔서 감사합니다.\n우헤헤헤…… 기쁘다, 헤헤헤…….",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "eba2882a795196c9cbc655951826f826c3a720c92a1ef1cc227a7170e0f11b06:000000_-3980315688597344077:g0:r8",
      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "アルギュロ",
        "Emt8_Shy",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "いらっしゃい、ご主人さま。\nこんな山奥まで来てくれて、ありがとうございます。\nうぇへへへ……嬉しいなぁ、へへへ……。",
        "",
        "ch_10075/R18/10075A0_10075_Nml/10075A0_10075_001",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "アルギュロ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": "ch_10075/R18/10075A0_10075_Nml/10075A0_10075_001"
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "3225b694a9d87f94de08b737091a9e2559e044b7479f9565d81709944fde8e70",
