      "row_index_0based": 10,
      "serialized_row_index": 10,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "こっ、これは……すごいですね。\n本に、鎧や武器に、彫像まで……。\nこれ、ぜんぶアルギュロさんが集めたんですか？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "efa62042d48b0a1ffa245fb8b126ed11a11d881855db8c864512a41b6c7007c0",
