      "grid_message_index_0based": 4,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ええ、その通りです。\nこの島にやってきた人間が、逃げ帰る時に置いていった\n物を回収していたら、気が付けばこんなことに……。",
      "jp_sha256": "1cac0073b4a7e9c8e2938b4049e526ca4261e1922bc4e004e67f74216040b858",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "네, 그렇습니다.\n이 섬에 온 인간들이 도망칠 때 두고 간\n물건을 회수하다 보니 어느새 이렇게…….",
      "message_index_0based": 4,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 12,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "eba2882a795196c9cbc655951826f826c3a720c92a1ef1cc227a7170e0f11b06:000000_-3980315688597344077:g0:r11",
      "row_index_0based": 11,
      "serialized_row_index": 11,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "アルギュロ",
        "Emt4_Enj",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "ええ、その通りです。\nこの島にやってきた人間が、逃げ帰る時に置いていった\n物を回収していたら、気が付けばこんなことに……。",
        "",
        "ch_10075/R18/10075A0_10075_Nml/10075A0_10075_002",
